==Trivia==
*Legeluga differs from other ''unevolved'' Lugas in that:
**Its DPS at level 30 is 510 instead of 933.
**Its attack cycle lasts for 150 frames instead of 82.
**Its attack foreswing is 7 frames long instead of 13.
**It has a recharge time of 324.53 seconds (the same as most of the Pasalans) instead of 24.87.
***The first three points would later be covered again by [[Furiluga (Uber Rare Cat)|Furiluga]], who also has a different attack cycle and DPS compared to other unevolved Lugas.
*Legelan Pasalan resembles [[jojowiki:Yoshikage_Kira|Yoshikage Kira]]'s Stand, [[jojowiki:Killer_Queen|Killer Queen]], from ''[[jojowiki:Diamond_is_Unbreakable|Jojo's Bizarre Adventure, Part 4: Diamond is Unbreakable]]''.
*Legelan Pasalan's description in the [[Tales of the Nekoluga (Gacha Event)|Tales of the Nekoluga]] event info used to be the same as [[Togeluga (Uber Rare Cat)|Togelan Pasalan]]'s (''"A Luga with massive damage at looooong range, who survives one lethal attack and gets stronger as she takes damage!"'') This was fixed at an unknown date.
**Furthermore, Togelan Pasalan's event info description was later changed to: ''"A Luga who delivers Massive Damage at Long-Range, with the ability to Survive one lethal strike.  Area attacks get stronger after taking damage. Plus, Immune to Wave Damage."''
*Legelan Pasalan has the fastest movement speed and shortest time between attacks of all Lugas and Pasalans.
*Legeluga is one of the units to have its description rewritten in [[Version 14.5 Update|Version 14.5]], as "immune to Wave damage" was changed to "immune to Waves".
*Legeluga, [[Wonder MOMOCO (Legend Rare Cat)|Wonder MOMOCO]] and [[Emperor Cat (Legend Rare Cat)|Emperor Cat]] are the only [[:Category:Legend Rare Cats|Legend Rare Cats]] to not have the Insane Damage or Insanely Tough abilities.

